# Build context of the root Dockerfile (BuildKit reads this file instead of
# .dockerignore, which belongs to the older routing/ and applier/ images).
# An allowlist: Go sources, vendored modules, the license texts shipped in the
# image, and the assets the binary embeds.
**
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!vendor/
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY.md
!panel/static/
!applier/PIA-CA-LICENSE.txt
**/*_test.go
